WEBVTT

00:24:50.698 --> 00:24:54.118
You want ollivanders.
There ain't no place better.

00:24:54.827 --> 00:24:59.915
Run along there and wait.
I got one more thing to do.

00:25:17.933 --> 00:25:19.768
Hello?

00:25:22.730 --> 00:25:24.565
Hello?

00:25:28.068 --> 00:25:32.364
I wondered when
I'd be seeing you, Mr. Potter.

00:25:40.164 --> 00:25:42.374
It seems only yesterday...

00:25:42.624 --> 00:25:48.464
That your mother and father were
in here buying their first wands.

00:25:55.137 --> 00:25:57.431
Here we are.

00:26:05.981 --> 00:26:08.567
Give it a wave.

00:26:14.990 --> 00:26:17.576
Apparently not.

00:26:25.000 --> 00:26:27.211
Perhaps...

00:26:28.837 --> 00:26:31.006
This.

00:26:38.097 --> 00:26:42.726
No, no, definitely not. No matter.

00:26:49.942 --> 00:26:51.527
I wonder...

00:27:20.764 --> 00:27:23.058
Curious.

00:27:23.267 --> 00:27:26.186
Very curious.

00:27:26.395 --> 00:27:29.523
Sorry, but what's curious?

00:27:31.233 --> 00:27:34.528
I remember every wand
I've ever sold, Mr. Potter.

00:27:34.736 --> 00:27:37.489
It so happens that the Phoenix...

00:27:37.698 --> 00:27:42.411
Whose tail feather resides
in your wand, gave another feather.

00:27:42.828 --> 00:27:45.914
Just one other.

00:27:46.081 --> 00:27:50.419
It is curious that you should
be destined for this wand...

00:27:50.711 --> 00:27:56.383
When its brother gave you that scar.

00:27:58.218 --> 00:28:01.430
And who owned that wand?

00:28:02.264 --> 00:28:04.683
We do not speak his name.

00:28:05.100 --> 00:28:08.604
The wand chooses
the wizard, Mr. Potter.

00:28:08.854 --> 00:28:11.857
It's not always clear why.

00:28:12.232 --> 00:28:15.736
But I think it is clear...

00:28:15.944 --> 00:28:19.865
That we can expect
great things from you.

00:28:20.073 --> 00:28:24.328
After all, he-who-must-not-be-named...

00:28:24.578 --> 00:28:27.247
Did great things.

00:28:27.456 --> 00:28:29.458
Terrible...

00:28:29.917 --> 00:28:33.128
Yes, but great.

00:28:38.800 --> 00:28:40.844
Hagrid: Harry! Harry!
